{
  "id": "ROM.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Abaroma 6",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abafu khubwonooni, ne abalamu muKristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho khusunje khurie? Khutsiililile mubwonooni, mbu obukoosia mana bushilaane? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'A, nahatuutu ta. Ifwe abafwa halubeka lwobwonooni, khwakhanyala khurie okhutsiililila okhumenya mubwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nohomba mushili okhumanya mbu ifwe fwesi ababatisibwa nikhwinjisibwa muKristo Yesu khwabatisibwa nikhwinjisibwa mukhufwakhwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako khwayabilwa ninaye halala nikhwinjisibwa mukhufwa khulwa obubatisibwi; mbu mana shinga Kristo olwa yalamusibwa okhurula mukhufwa khulwa oluyali lwaSeefwe, neefu fwesi khurio khuchende mubuIamu obuyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila nikhuba nikhwaliimaasibwa ninaye khulwa okhufwa khulala nende okhukhwe, khuliba khurio khandi khulwa okhulamusibwa khulala nende okhukhwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khwamanya likhuwa lino, mbu imela yeefwe yakhale yabambilwa khumusalaba halala ninaye, mbu omubili omwonooni mana kuhweho, ifwe nikhuraba abasumba bobwonooni khandi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba omundu owafwa nomulekhuule halubeka lu obwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nikhuba nikhwafwa halala nende Kristo, khusuubila mbu khulabaho abalamu ninaye khurio; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikhumanyile mbu Kristo olwa yalamusibwa okhurula mukhufwa, shialifwa khandi ta; okhufwa shikhushilikhwo nende oburuchi khuye ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba okhufwa, yafwila obwonooni lulala lwonyene; ne okhuba omulamu, abeetsanga omulamu khuNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nineenywe mwesi murio mwibasie abeene shinga olwa muli abafu khubwonooni, habula abalamu khuNyasaye muKristo Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, murafuchiilila obwonooni okhuruka mumibili chieenywe chioburulanda, mbu mukholenje akobwikombi bwachio obubii, tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mureehaananga ebiungo bieenywe khubwonooni bibe ebimanulwa biobumayaanu ta; ne mwihaane khuNyasaye, shinga olwa mwalamuushe okhurula mukhufwa, nende ebiungo bieenywe mbu bibe shinga ebimanulwa biobulunjishi khuNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba obwonooni shibulabakhwo noburuchi khwinywe ta; shichila shimuli abasumba bamalako ta, habula abasumba bobukoosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasumba bobulunjishi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho karie? Khuloonoonanga, shichila shikhuli abasumba bamalako ta, habula bobukoosia? 'A, nahatuutu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimumanyile mbu olwa muba nimwihaanile abeene khumundu okhuba abasumbabe abamuhulila, muli abasumba bomwenoyo owa muhulilanga; kata abasumba bobwonooni obuleera okhufwa, kata bobuhulili obuleera obulunjishi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumuupila Nyasaye orio, shichila olwa mwalinji abasumba bobwonooni, mwachaaka okhuhulila nokhukhola nende omwoyo kwosi omufwano kwobuchesi okwa mwahaanilwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne olwa mwalekhuulwa mubusumba bwobwonooni, mwakwa abasumba bobulunjishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esunga shinga omundu namundu khulwa obuteshele bwemibili chieenywe. Shichila shinga olwa mweehaana ebiungo bieenywe bibe shinga abasumba beshifwabwi nende obumayaanu obuleera obumayaanu, bulaano mwihaane muri nanwa ebiungo bieenywe bibe abasumba bobulunjishi obuleera obutakatifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba olwa mwalinji abasumba bobwonooni, mwali abalekhuule halubeka Iwobulunjishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nebiamo shiina ebia mwanyoola mundaalo etsio khumakhuwa ako aka bulaano mufwimbilwa emirwe? Okhuba obumaliilishi bwako nokhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano olwa mulekhuulilwe mubusumba bwobwonooni, nimukwa abasumba baNyasaye, muli nende ebiamo bieenywe ebileera obulakatifu, nobumaliilishi bwabio nobulamu bwobumeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba omushaara kwobwonooni nokhufwa; ne eshihaanwa shiaNyasaye nobulamu bwobumeli muKristo Yesu Omwami weefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
